    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>“Power is not rage. Power is what still obeys you after the world breaks.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): Violence (Warlord).</strong> Commander, breaker, disciplined engine of force. You do not merely hit hard — you make force coherent.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your Domain earns <strong>+10 Violence</strong> marks each turn while you serve it.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for the full tactical and strategic expression of battlefield command, violent pressure, and military dominance.</p></li></ul>",
